       \n\n\n  \n    <div class=\"summary-thumbnail-outer-container\">\n      <a href=\"/blognews/mobility-stories-across-europe\" class=\"\n          summary-thumbnail-container\n          sqs-gallery-image-container\n          \n        \" data-title=\"Mobility Stories Across Europe:  the North Optimizes while the South struggles to catch up\" data-description=\"\" aria-label=\"Mobility Stories Across Europe:  the North Optimizes while the South struggles to catch up\">\n        <div class=\"summary-thumbnail img-wrapper\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n  \n\n  \n      <!-- Main Image -->\n      <img data-src=\"/media/pexels-julia-isanta-munoz-626361636-28799879-fad885e8.jpg\" data-image=\"/media/pexels-julia-isanta-munoz-626361636-28799879-fad885e8.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"2592x1944\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Mobility Stories Across Europe:  the North Optimizes while the South struggles to catch up\" data-load=\"false\" class=\"summary-thumbnail-image\" elementtiming=\"summary-thumbnail-image-carousel\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n    <!-- Products: Quick View -->\n    \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n          <div class=\"summary-content sqs-gallery-meta-container\" data-animation-role=\"content\">\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--above-title\">\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary\">\n\n\n\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class=\"summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date\" datetime=\"2026-05-05\">May 5, 2026</time>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--secondary\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-title\">\n              <a href=\"/blognews/mobility-stories-across-europe\" class=\"summary-title-link\">\n                Mobility Stories Across Europe:  the North Optimizes while the South struggles to catch up\n              </a>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--below-title\">\n            \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary\">\n\n\n\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class=\"summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date\" datetime=\"2026-05-05\">May 5, 2026</time>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--secondary\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n              \n              <div class=\"\n                summary-excerpt\n                summary-excerpt-only\n              \"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A review of just 9 citizen stories on the topic of mobility and transport coming from 7 countries from across Europe reveals a striking regional divide, not simply in infrastructure quality, but in how people experience governance itself through transport.</p></div>\n            \n            \n            \n            <a href=\"/blognews/mobility-stories-across-europe\" class=\"summary-read-more-link\">Read more →</a>\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--below-content\">\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary\">\n\n\n\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class=\"summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date\" datetime=\"2026-05-05\">May 5, 2026</time>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--secondary\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"\n          summary-item\n          positioned\n          summary-item-record-type-text\n          sqs-gallery-design-carousel-slide\n          \n          \n            summary-item-has-thumbnail\n          \n           summary-item-has-excerpt\n          \n          \n          summary-item-has-author\n          \n          \n          \">\n          \n          \n\n\n  \n    <div class=\"summary-thumbnail-outer-container\">\n      <a href=\"/blognews/lolirgfneah3kvdmy6fiqcen1q0aed\" class=\"\n          summary-thumbnail-container\n          sqs-gallery-image-container\n          \n        \" data-title=\"AI Isn’t the Story — People Are: What 75 Real Experiences Reveal\" data-description=\"\" aria-label=\"AI Isn’t the Story — People Are: What 75 Real Experiences Reveal\">\n        <div class=\"summary-thumbnail img-wrapper\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n  \n\n  \n      <!-- Main Image -->\n      <img data-src=\"/media/ChatGPT-Image-17-mar-2026--10_47_34-46154f2d.png\" data-image=\"/media/ChatGPT-Image-17-mar-2026--10_47_34-46154f2d.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"1536x1024\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"AI Isn’t the Story — People Are: What 75 Real Experiences Reveal\" data-load=\"false\" class=\"summary-thumbnail-image\" elementtiming=\"summary-thumbnail-image-carousel\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n    <!-- Products: Quick View -->\n    \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n          <div class=\"summary-content sqs-gallery-meta-container\" data-animation-role=\"content\">\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--above-title\">\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary\">\n\n\n\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class=\"summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date\" datetime=\"2026-03-17\">March 17, 2026</time>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--secondary\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-title\">\n              <a href=\"/blognews/lolirgfneah3kvdmy6fiqcen1q0aed\" class=\"summary-title-link\">\n                AI Isn’t the Story — People Are: What 75 Real Experiences Reveal\n              </a>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--below-title\">\n            \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary\">\n\n\n\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class=\"summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date\" datetime=\"2026-03-17\">March 17, 2026</time>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--secondary\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n              \n              <div class=\"\n                summary-excerpt\n                summary-excerpt-only\n              \"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Real experiences with AI reveal a clear pattern: the same tools can enable agency or create harm. What shapes the outcome isn’t the technology, but control, accountability, and governance.</p></div>\n            \n            \n            \n            <a href=\"/blognews/lolirgfneah3kvdmy6fiqcen1q0aed\" class=\"summary-read-more-link\">Read more →</a>\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--below-content\">\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary\">\n\n\n\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class=\"summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date\" datetime=\"2026-03-17\">March 17, 2026</time>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--secondary\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"\n          summary-item\n          positioned\n          summary-item-record-type-text\n          sqs-gallery-design-carousel-slide\n          \n          \n            summary-item-has-thumbnail\n          \n           summary-item-has-excerpt\n          \n          \n          summary-item-has-author\n          \n          \n          \">\n          \n          \n\n\n  \n    <div class=\"summary-thumbnail-outer-container\">\n      <a href=\"/blognews/reimagining-democracy-eurosense-pilot-project-results-are-here\" class=\"\n          summary-thumbnail-container\n          sqs-gallery-image-container\n          \n        \" data-title=\"Reimagining Democracy: EuroSense Pilot Project Results Are Here!\" data-description=\"\" aria-label=\"Reimagining Democracy: EuroSense Pilot Project Results Are Here!\">\n        <div class=\"summary-thumbnail img-wrapper\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n  \n\n  \n      <!-- Main Image -->\n      <img data-src=\"/media/Primary-Analysis-Report-70650a03.png\" data-image=\"/media/Primary-Analysis-Report-70650a03.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"512x298\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Reimagining Democracy: EuroSense Pilot Project Results Are Here!\" data-load=\"false\" class=\"summary-thumbnail-image\" elementtiming=\"summary-thumbnail-image-carousel\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n    <!-- Products: Quick View -->\n    \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n          <div class=\"summary-content sqs-gallery-meta-container\" data-animation-role=\"content\">\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--above-title\">\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary\">\n\n\n\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class=\"summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date\" datetime=\"2025-04-10\">April 10, 2025</time>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--secondary\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-title\">\n              <a href=\"/blognews/reimagining-democracy-eurosense-pilot-project-results-are-here\" class=\"summary-title-link\">\n                Reimagining Democracy: EuroSense Pilot Project Results Are Here!\n              </a>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--below-title\">\n            \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary\">\n\n\n\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class=\"summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date\" datetime=\"2025-04-10\">April 10, 2025</time>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--secondary\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n              \n              <div class=\"\n                summary-excerpt\n                summary-excerpt-only\n              \"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">We are thrilled to announce the release of the 𝗘𝘂𝗿𝗼𝗦𝗲𝗻𝘀𝗲 𝗣𝗿𝗶𝗺𝗮𝗿𝘆 𝗔𝗻𝗮𝗹𝘆𝘀𝗶𝘀 𝗥𝗲𝗽𝗼𝗿𝘁, a groundbreaking initiative powered by Volt Europa and driven by citizen scientists across Europe. This report represents one step forward to understanding polarization, empowering citizens, and building a more inclusive democratic society. Read more here…</p></div>\n            \n            \n            \n            <a href=\"/blognews/reimagining-democracy-eurosense-pilot-project-results-are-here\" class=\"summary-read-more-link\">Read more →</a>\n            \n            <div class=\"summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--below-content\">\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary\">\n\n\n\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class=\"summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date\" datetime=\"2025-04-10\">April 10, 2025</time>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n              \n              <div class=\"summary-metadata summary-metadata--secondary\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div>",
